## Interface: 16001
## Title: ForeverScribe
## Notes: Read-only character journal for your AI agent (saved when you /reload or log out). Item tooltips show auction prices your agent wrote, the profession window shows craft cost and profit, /scribe way and /fs go set map pins. No network, no automation. Type /scribe for options.
## Author: ForeverScribe contributors
## Version: 0.10.0
